====Himmlische Seele====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|name=Himmlische Seele
|moveId=kain_236236B
|input=236236B
|description= * An incredible use of Kain's meter, and one of the best Ignition gears in the game.
* Starts up fast enough, covers a solid amount of the screen, and is +8 point blank on block, making it Kain's turn no matter where this connects on the opponent.
* Launches on hit, giving Kain extended juggles anywhere. This can cause Kain's damage to absolutely skyrocket with meter.
* Though expensive, this can be thrown out semi-randomly at mid range if desired, forcing a reaction or + frames from the opponent.
* Does considerable chip/REV damage, and slows down significantly on JD/HD, which can be worse for the opponent if they guess wrong after. Because of this, Kain can lead the opponent to checkmate scenarios where they have to DP/JD/REV guard for their life at low health on burnout/high REV gauge with enough meter.
}}

